            "content": "## Test data assumption\n\n`missingText` in **Set Variables** is intentionally declared without a value so it resolves to `undefined` downstream. Do not fill it in - the flow tests that **Condition** handles a missing input (issue #2903).\n\nIf a Condition is routed to the wrong port, its Assert never fires and **After All** fails on timeout."
